Unleash raw, chaotic elemental damage upon your enemy.

You strike your enemy for [155%, 170%, 181%, 191%, 200% (TL1-5)] weapon damage in one of blinding sand, disarming acid, freezing and slowing ice, dazing lightning or stunning flames, with equal odds.

Additionally, you will cause a burst that deals [140, 188, 226, 258, 286 (TL1-5; MP 100)] of that damage to creatures in radius [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)], regardless of if you hit with the blow.

Levels in Prismatic Slash increase your Physical and Mental attack speeds by [2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10% (TL1-5)].

This talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.
